----------------------------------------
 Land Cover Type Library (lctlib) files
----------------------------------------

Currently lctlib files for jsbach have 21 land cover types (nlct21), while the
quincy lctlib files define 14 different land cover types (nlct14).


 JSBACH lctlib files
---------------------

- lctlib_nlct21.def:   Original version

- lctlib_nlct21_cmip7.def:   Same as lctlib_nlct21.def with the exception of
  parameter "Fract_npp_2_woodPool" (fraction of NPP going to the vegetation wood
  pool), being increased for all woody vegetation to increase global biomass
  (compare https://gitlab.dkrz.de/jsbach/jsbach/-/issues/376).
  This lctlib file should be used in setups with carbon cycle and PFT fractions
  based on ESACCI land cover maps, which is typically the case in 12-PFT-setups.


QUINCY lctlib files
---------------------

- lctlib_quincy_nlct14.def:   Original version

